# Multi-option example
~ start
combee: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
combee: Here are some choices.
- First one
	combee: You picked the first one.
- Second one
	combee: You picked the second one.
# Dialogue jumping example
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => END
# Mutation Line conditional example
#- Rare answer [if GameState.has_met_nathan /]
combee: For more information see the online documentation.
=> END

~ nobody
# Variable checking example
if StoryManager.story_progression_check("NewAreaFound")
	Hey, it seems you've progressed the story. Still a nobody, though
else
	Hey, this is a dialogue test with nobody.
=> END

~ emotion
rotom,excited: Hello!!! This is an emotion test
rotom: This is normal talking. How is it?
rotom,worried: Really hope it's working well...
rotom,shocked: Shocked face.
=> END

~ clio
clio: This is a more specific character test
clio: This is a test for a long sentence. I want to see if the textbox will change size when text is added, or if it stays the same throughout. Considering which will look better, I am unsure.
clio: Also, [i][wave amp=25 freq=5]BOO![/wave][/i]

